a:1:{i:28;a:6:{s:9:"faq_title";s:0:"";s:3:"faq";a:5:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:71:"What factors should I consider when choosing a suitable overhead crane?";s:6:"answer";s:433:"When buying a overhead crane, many customers only focus on price and end up with equipment that does not match their workshop conditions. The most important factors are lifting weight, workshop span, ceiling height, working frequency and working environment. We configure the most suitable crane solution according to your actual site data, avoiding over configuration wasting budget or insufficient performance affecting production.";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:74:"Are your overhead cranes suitable for high-frequency heavy industrial use?";s:6:"answer";s:391:"Many ordinary cranes on the market are prone to deformation, motor heating and frequent failures after long-time heavy use. Our single and double girder overhead cranes adopt reinforced steel structure and industrial-grade core components, designed for long-hour, high-frequency factory operation. Stable performance, low failure rate, and effectively reduce your production shutdown losses.";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:71:"Can you modify and customize the crane for special workshop conditions?";s:6:"answer";s:379:"Many customers have troubles such as low factory ceiling, limited installation space, special rail positions or dust/high temperature environment. We support full non-standard customization, including low-headroom design, anti-corrosion, explosion-proof, dust-proof and customized span and height. No need to renovate your workshop, the crane can be perfectly installed and used.";}i:3;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:66:"How about your overseas after-sales service and technical support?";s:6:"answer";s:356:"Overseas users are most worried about no technical support and difficult maintenance after purchasing equipment. We provide lifelong online technical guidance, remote debugging and fault diagnosis. Complete English installation manuals, video tutorials and sufficient spare parts support ensure you can solve daily maintenance problems by yourself quickly.";}i:4;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:72:"Do your overhead cranes meet international safety and quality standards?";s:6:"answer";s:339:"Unqualified cranes will cause customs detention and potential safety hazards. All our overhead cranes comply with CE, ISO, FEM and other international standards, with complete test reports and certification documents. Strict factory quality inspection ensures stable safety performance and fully meets local industrial safety requirements.";}}s:17:"faq_contact_title";s:27:"Can not Find Your Question?";s:16:"faq_contact_desc";s:79:"If you can not find the answer, contact us and let us know how we can help you.";s:20:"faq_contact_btn_text";s:10:"Contact Us";s:20:"faq_contact_btn_link";s:0:"";}}